
------------------------------ pkt_process delay status ---------------------------------
Implication: 
	10000, 40000, 70000 is CPU-Cycle range, the value below this is packet number.
	AVG, MAX is CPU-Cycle statistics of processed packet.
	For example, if CPU frequency is 2000MHz, CPU-Cycle is 2000, means delay is 1us.
